{"name":"Bayshore","hex":"#89cee0","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Bayshore, Ottawa","blocks":[{"text":"Bayshore is a neighbourhood in Bay Ward in the west end of Ottawa, Ontario, Canada. Prior to amalgamation in 2001, the neighbourhood was in the City of Nepean. It is bounded east by row houses off Bayshore Drive, to the north Carling Avenue, to the west Holly Acres Drive and the Lakeview neighbourhood, and to the south Ontario Highway 417. The main street in Bayshore is Woodridge Crescent, while the Bayshore Station is the major bus transit station."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/Bayshore_Shopping_Ctr.jpg/330px-Bayshore_Shopping_Ctr.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bayshore%2C_Ottawa","wikidata":"Q4874792"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/Bayshore_Shopping_Ctr.jpg/500px-Bayshore_Shopping_Ctr.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/Bayshore_Shopping_Ctr.jpg/1280px-Bayshore_Shopping_Ctr.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/Bayshore_Shopping_Ctr.jpg/500px-Bayshore_Shopping_Ctr.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABayshore_Shopping_Ctr.jpg"}],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"The blue of the sky","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/The_blue_of_the_sky.jpg/500px-The_blue_of_the_sky.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_blue_of_the_sky.jpg","share":0.09125},{"title":"TE29 Bayshore Under Construction","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/TE29_Bayshore_Under_Construction.jpg/500px-TE29_Bayshore_Under